1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:01,567
Notary.

2
00:00:01,733 --> 00:00:04,533
No certificate, no money moves.

3
00:00:06,133 --> 00:00:08,833
AI agents are starting to move real money:

4
00:00:08,867 --> 00:00:10,967
refunds, plan changes, credits.

5
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:13,233
They learn how from API docs.

6
00:00:13,367 --> 00:00:16,533
But docs and real APIs disagree.

7
00:00:16,967 --> 00:00:19,900
We pointed our agent at two real APIs,

8
00:00:19,933 --> 00:00:22,367
Crustdata and Dodo Payments.

9
00:00:22,533 --> 00:00:24,800
Crustdata's own docs say a company lookup

10
00:00:24,833 --> 00:00:27,300
with no match returns an empty result.

11
00:00:27,533 --> 00:00:30,167
In our run, it returned an error instead,

12
00:00:30,200 --> 00:00:32,867
and three documented claims didn't hold.

13
00:00:32,900 --> 00:00:34,733
An agent that trusts the docs breaks

14
00:00:34,767 --> 00:00:37,200
on exactly these cases.

15
00:00:38,067 --> 00:00:40,033
Notary won't touch money until it

16
00:00:40,067 --> 00:00:42,467
has proven how its tools behave.

17
00:00:42,633 --> 00:00:45,767
It turns every promise in the docs into a claim,

18
00:00:45,900 --> 00:00:48,333
commits a hashed prediction before each test

19
00:00:48,367 --> 00:00:52,067
call, then calls the API and compares.

20
00:00:52,600 --> 00:00:55,067
A Reflector proposes explanations,

21
00:00:55,100 --> 00:00:57,900
and a stronger Adversary tries to refute them.

22
00:00:58,333 --> 00:01:01,900
In our runs, it narrowed all five beliefs.

23
00:01:02,033 --> 00:01:04,467
What survives becomes a certificate.

24
00:01:04,667 --> 00:01:07,233
No certificate, no money moves:

25
00:01:07,267 --> 00:01:11,367
the Guard holds anything uncovered for a person to review.

26
00:01:12,200 --> 00:01:14,567
neatlogs is how we looked into these incidents

27
00:01:14,600 --> 00:01:17,033
and checked how each one was resolved.

28
00:01:17,200 --> 00:01:19,367
Each run is one trace,

29
00:01:19,400 --> 00:01:22,467
with every probe and model call behind it.

30
00:01:22,733 --> 00:01:25,933
On the Crustdata run, the trace showed a disputed

31
00:01:25,967 --> 00:01:28,933
claim's prediction, logged with its hash before

32
00:01:28,967 --> 00:01:32,167
the call, and an inconclusive result.

33
00:01:32,333 --> 00:01:33,933
So Notary abstained,

34
00:01:33,967 --> 00:01:36,900
and no payment can depend on that claim.

35
00:01:37,233 --> 00:01:40,733
Two more mismatches stay open and uncertified,

36
00:01:40,767 --> 00:01:42,533
so the Guard blocks them.

37
00:01:42,967 --> 00:01:46,867
On the Dodo run, the trace showed the Adversary narrowing four

38
00:01:46,900 --> 00:01:51,167
beliefs, like wallet credits in minor units only for US dollars,

39
00:01:51,200 --> 00:01:54,833
so Notary certified only that narrower scope.

40
00:01:55,667 --> 00:01:58,367
Entire captured how Notary was built.

41
00:01:58,467 --> 00:02:00,833
Seven checkpoints tie each commit to the

42
00:02:00,867 --> 00:02:03,200
coding-agent session that wrote it.

43
00:02:03,367 --> 00:02:06,733
Notary also uses Entire's code graph to

44
00:02:06,767 --> 00:02:08,567
prove a safety property:

45
00:02:08,733 --> 00:02:12,300
every call that can move money goes through a guard.

46
00:02:12,367 --> 00:02:15,033
Zero unguarded call sites.

47
00:02:15,867 --> 00:02:18,633
cfo.ai runs the business side.

48
00:02:18,767 --> 00:02:21,400
Notary measures what certainty costs,

49
00:02:21,467 --> 00:02:25,300
about three cents of model spend and fifteen Crustdata credits

50
00:02:25,333 --> 00:02:31,000
per run, exports those real costs to cfo.ai as a data source,

51
00:02:31,033 --> 00:02:36,100
and connects to cfo.ai's MCP server to sync the plan back.

52
00:02:36,133 --> 00:02:39,367
And it's built to deploy on AWS.

53
00:02:40,200 --> 00:02:42,933
On our test suite, the agent without Notary

54
00:02:42,967 --> 00:02:45,367
made nine unsafe money moves.

55
00:02:45,400 --> 00:02:49,667
With Notary, zero, and nine refunds held for review.

56
00:02:49,833 --> 00:02:50,833
Notary.

57
00:02:51,000 --> 00:02:53,900
No certificate, no money moves.
